{"5075470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sky Bomber", "steam_appid": 5075470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies as a fearless stickman pilot and unleash chaos from above. Bomb enemy fortresses, destroy military camps, and watch entire structures collapse thanks to satisfying physics-based destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/78f683dd55e67dcb2c416908f21d804d.poster.avif?t=1787588556\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/78f683dd55e67dcb2c416908f21d804d.webm?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/78f683dd55e67dcb2c416908f21d804d.mp4?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a chance to find the perfect attack angle. Dive toward enemy defenses, fire your aircraft cannon, drop devastating bombs, and pull off daring aerial maneuvers before climbing back into the sky. One well-placed strike can bring down an entire fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/780f1c2e4eed2737f061fd301e764b06.poster.avif?t=1787588556\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/780f1c2e4eed2737f061fd301e764b06.webm?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/780f1c2e4eed2737f061fd301e764b06.mp4?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is fully interactive. Buildings crumble, towers collapse, vehicles explode, and enemy stickmen are sent flying in hilarious chain reactions. Every explosion feels powerful, rewarding, and different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/1373a5ae24d2429fad1fc87120a3edfa.poster.avif?t=1787588556\" width=1170 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/1373a5ae24d2429fad1fc87120a3edfa.webm?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/1373a5ae24d2429fad1fc87120a3edfa.mp4?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, unlock new aircraft and upgrade your favorite plane with stronger weapons, heavier bombs, improved armor, and better flight performance. Experiment with different loadouts to create your own style of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer precision bombing or overwhelming firepower, every battle rewards skill, timing, and clever attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/4ddc225bb1b62dcad27ebfe29ce2a783.poster.avif?t=1787588556\" width=1170 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/4ddc225bb1b62dcad27ebfe29ce2a783.webm?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/4ddc225bb1b62dcad27ebfe29ce2a783.mp4?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based destruction with satisfying explosions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly a variety of aircraft with unique characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons, bombs, armor, and flight performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy enemy buildings, vehicles, and military defenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform aerial loops and precision bombing runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny stickman enemies with dynamic ragdoll reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, challenging to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless opportunities to cause spectacular destruction from the sky</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies as a fearless stickman pilot and unleash chaos from above. Bomb enemy fortresses, destroy military camps, and watch entire structures collapse thanks to satisfying physics-based destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/78f683dd55e67dcb2c416908f21d804d.poster.avif?t=1787588556\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/78f683dd55e67dcb2c416908f21d804d.webm?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/78f683dd55e67dcb2c416908f21d804d.mp4?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a chance to find the perfect attack angle. Dive toward enemy defenses, fire your aircraft cannon, drop devastating bombs, and pull off daring aerial maneuvers before climbing back into the sky. One well-placed strike can bring down an entire fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/780f1c2e4eed2737f061fd301e764b06.poster.avif?t=1787588556\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/780f1c2e4eed2737f061fd301e764b06.webm?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/780f1c2e4eed2737f061fd301e764b06.mp4?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is fully interactive. Buildings crumble, towers collapse, vehicles explode, and enemy stickmen are sent flying in hilarious chain reactions. Every explosion feels powerful, rewarding, and different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/1373a5ae24d2429fad1fc87120a3edfa.poster.avif?t=1787588556\" width=1170 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/1373a5ae24d2429fad1fc87120a3edfa.webm?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/1373a5ae24d2429fad1fc87120a3edfa.mp4?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, unlock new aircraft and upgrade your favorite plane with stronger weapons, heavier bombs, improved armor, and better flight performance. Experiment with different loadouts to create your own style of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer precision bombing or overwhelming firepower, every battle rewards skill, timing, and clever attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/4ddc225bb1b62dcad27ebfe29ce2a783.poster.avif?t=1787588556\" width=1170 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/4ddc225bb1b62dcad27ebfe29ce2a783.webm?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/extras/4ddc225bb1b62dcad27ebfe29ce2a783.mp4?t=1787588556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based destruction with satisfying explosions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly a variety of aircraft with unique characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons, bombs, armor, and flight performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy enemy buildings, vehicles, and military defenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform aerial loops and precision bombing runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny stickman enemies with dynamic ragdoll reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, challenging to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless opportunities to cause spectacular destruction from the sky</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Fly your warplane, bomb enemy stickman bases, and unleash satisfying physics-based destruction. Upgrade your aircraft, master precision bombing, and level everything in your path.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/660dc82c4cb64c22934b1d2fbc88f1d412281a41/header.jpg?t=1787588556", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5075470/43d7f940d5ea3f1218bf663259821b7320837f20/c